- Tests verify the live preview configuration change:
  1. When `CONTENTSTACK_LIVE_PREVIEW=true`, options include `live_preview` with `enable: true`, the management token, and custom host
  2. The `live_preview` config is passed through to `contentstack.Stack()` so the SDK can serve draft content
  3. Default preview host (`https://preview.contentstack.io`) is used when `CONTENTSTACK_PREVIEW_HOST` is not set
  4. When live preview is not active (`CONTENTSTACK_LIVE_PREVIEW=""`), `live_preview` is absent from options — only published content is served
  5. Options without `live_preview` are passed to `contentstack.Stack()`
  6. `CONTENTSTACK_LIVE_PREVIEW="false"` does not enable live preview
  7. `CONTENTSTACK_LIVE_PREVIEW="yes"` (any non-"true" value) does not enable live preview
